    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about stopping the performance though. i mean like, even if i stop pretending, the world is still there and it's still hateful. i just feel like i've run out of options. like, maybe there's just nothing left for me in this life. do you think it's wrong to just want it to be over?",
